    "label": "순서도",
    "format": "<div class=\"cf-df\"><style>\n.cf-df{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#ececec;line-height:1.5;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;overflow:visible}\n.cf-df *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cf-df .t{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.08rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:700}\n.cf-df .sub{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#b0bec5}\n.cf-df .s{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:0.8rem;opacity:0.92}\n.cf-df .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin:6px 0 14px;align-items:stretch}\n.cf-df .card{flex:1;min-width:136px;max-width:210px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(168deg,#3d3d48,#28282e);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 10px;border:1px solid #555;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n.cf-df .ic svg{width:64px;height:64px;display:block;margin:0 auto 8px;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.45))}\n.cf-df .cap{font-size:0.64rem;color:#ffcc80;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}\n.cf-df .lab{font-size:0.84rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600}\n.cf-df .hint{font-size:0.7rem;color:#b0bec5;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.35}\n.cf-df .ar{align-self:center;font-size:1.3rem;color:#78909c;padding:0 2px}\n.cf-df .host{margin-top:10px;background:#222228;border:1px solid #3f3f4a;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px 10px}\n.cf-df .host h5{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.86rem;color:#81c784}\n.cf-df .hg{margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #35353d}\n.cf-df .hg:last-child{border-bottom:none;margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}\n.cf-df .ht{font-size:0.78rem;color:#ffcc80;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}\n.cf-df .hb{font-family:Consolas,ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:0.71rem;color:#e6e6e6;line-height:1.55;word-break:break-all}\n.cf-df .hb a,.cf-df .det a,.cf-df .arch-full a{color:#80deea;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(128,222,234,.45)}\n.cf-df details{border:1px solid #45454f;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0;background:#292931;padding:2px 10px}\n.cf-df summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:0.84rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:700;padding:10px 4px;list-style-position:outside}\n.cf-df .det{font-size:0.73rem;color:#cfd8dc;padding:8px 6px 12px;border-top:1px solid #3a3a44}\n.cf-df ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem}\n.cf-df li{margin:6px 0}\n.cf-df .note{margin-top:12px;border-left:4px solid #5c6bc0;padding:10px 12px;background:#2a2a32;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;font-size:0.72rem}\n.cf-df .note b{color:#fff}\n.cf-df pre{display:block;background:#16161c;color:#e6ee9c;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.67rem;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #333}\n.cf-df .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:0.6rem;color:#ffecb3;background:#4e342e;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;margin:2px 6px 0 0;font-weight:600}\n.cf-df code{font-size:0.88em;color:#fce4ec;background:#332833;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px}\n.cf-df .arch-full{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d9d9de;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0 10px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#111;line-height:1.6;text-align:left;overflow:visible;max-height:none}\n.cf-df .arch-full h6{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#1b5e20;font-weight:800}\n.cf-df .arch-full p{margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.55}\n.cf-df .arch-full ul{margin:6px 0 10px;padding-left:1.15rem}\n.cf-df .arch-full li{margin:5px 0}\n\n.cf-df .arch-full a{color:#006064;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(0,96,100,.35)}\n.cf-df .arch-full code{color:#4a148c;background:#f3e5f5}\n</style>\n<p class=\"t\">CronusFarm 개발환경</p>\n<p class=\"sub\">누적 개발 구성 반영 · 긴 문단은 아래 회색 박스에 통째로 둠(대시보드 텍스트 위젯은 줄 수 제한으로 잘림)</p>\n<p class=\"s\">워크플로우: 저장소 편집 → merge / deploy → Pi(ida)·USB 업로드 · Git(<code>git-push-with-backup.ps1</code>)</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"44\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#42a5f5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#0d47a1\" opacity=\"0.35\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"44\" width=\"52\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#64b5f6\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">개발</div><div class=\"lab\">PC</div><div class=\"hint\">Thalia · Artemis · Cursor</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#78909c\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"26\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#90a4ae\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"33\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"51\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">배포</div><div class=\"lab\">Pi ida</div><div class=\"hint\">Node-RED · MQTT · SQLite 브리지</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#81d4fa\" d=\"M46 38a11 11 0 0 0-10-8 13 13 0 0 0-24 2 10 10 0 0 0 9 17h23a8 8 0 0 0 2-11z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">현장</div><div class=\"lab\">UNO R4 메인</div><div class=\"hint\">MQTT tele/cmd · 릴레이/펌프/팬</div></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"s\">데이터 스택: SQLite(정합) &#8594; InfluxDB(시계열) &#8594; Grafana(대시·알림)</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">SQLite</div><div class=\"lab\">관계형</div><div class=\"hint\"><code>smartfarm.sqlite</code><br/>작물·스케줄·메타·이벤트</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">InfluxDB</div><div class=\"lab\">시계열</div><div class=\"hint\">tele·상태·알림·AI 등 시간축<br/>bucket 권장: <code>CronusFarm</code></div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">Grafana</div><div class=\"lab\">시각화</div><div class=\"hint\">Influx Flux 패널 · 알림</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"host\"><h5>호스트 · 패널 · 문서</h5>\n<div class=\"hg\"><div class=\"ht\">네트워크</div><div class=\"hb\">LAN 192.168.1.22 · WAN ida.mango-larch.ts.net</div><div class=\"hb\">SMB \\\\ida.mango-larch.ts.net\\MyCode &#8594; /home/dooly/CronusFarm</div></div>\n<div class=\"hg\"><div class=\"ht\">2004A 패널 (RepRapDiscount)</div>\n<div class=\"hb\"><span class=\"tag\">Mega·TriGorilla 시절 문서화</span><span class=\"tag\">현운영: UNO R3 패널 MCU</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\">R4(<code>CronusFarm.ino</code>) + R3(<code>CronusFarmPanel.ino</code>) · I2C 슬레이브 <code>0x38</code> · R4 A4/A5 &#8596; R3 A4/A5, GND 공통. UART D0/D1 직결 금지(업로드·충돌 방지).</div>\n<div class=\"hb\"><a href=\"mega.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mega.html</a> · <code>docs/v07_2004a_exp_wiring.md</code></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"arch-full\"><h6>구성요소 역할 / 데이터 흐름 (전문, 잘림 없음)</h6>\n<p>Arduino(센서/릴레이) &#8594; Node-RED(수집·정규화·저장·제어 API) &#8594; InfluxDB(시계열: tele / alert_events / ai_detections 등) &#8594; Grafana(시각화·알림)</p>\n<p><strong>InfluxDB</strong>: 시간축 데이터(센서·장치상태·알림·AI)를 저장한다. <strong>bucket은 CronusFarm 권장.</strong> Pi에서는 NR 환경변수(CRONUSFARM_INFLUX_*)로 토큰·ORG·bucket·최소 기록 간격을 맞춘다.</p>\n<p><strong>SQLite</strong>: 관계형(작물·스케줄·이미지·AI 메타·이벤트). Grafana에서 SQLite를 직접 조회하려면 플러그인 등 추가 구성이 필요하므로, <strong>기본 구성에서는 Node-RED가 시계열을 Influx에도 함께 넣는 방식</strong>을 권장한다(정합은 SQLite·시각화용 시계열은 Influx).</p>\n<p><strong>통신(Arduino &#8594; Node-RED)</strong>: MQTT 권장 — 저전력·retain 상태·pub/sub 확장·끊김 복구에 유리. 토픽 예: <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/tele</code>, <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/cmd</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; 패널: TriGorilla(Mega) 검토 후 UNO R3(2004A)로 전환</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li>2004A(EXP1/EXP2)용으로 TriGorilla·Mega2560(RAMPS류) 계열 문서·배선 레퍼런스가 있었고, <a href=\"mega.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mega.html</a> 에 남아 있다.</li>\n<li>운영에서는 메인(UNO R4 WiFi)과 분리하여 <strong>패널 전용 UNO R3</strong>로 고정: LCD·엔코더·부저 등은 R3, 제어·MQTT·릴레이는 R4.</li>\n<li>R4&#8596;R3 연결은 <strong>I2C</strong>(프로토콜 <code>panel_i2c_protocol.h</code>). EXP 핀맵은 &ldquo;현장 검증&rdquo;과 &ldquo;EXP 관례&rdquo; 두 갈래가 있어 하얀 화면 시 RS/EN/D4~7 정합을 문서 표와 맞출 것.</li>\n<li>스케치 경로: <code>arduino/CronusFarmPanel/</code>·<code>CronusFarmPanel_R3/</code> 등 저장소 기준.</li>\n</ul></div></details>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; DB / Influx / Grafana 도입</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li><strong>SQLite</strong>: <code>smartfarm.sqlite</code> 및 브리지 스크립트·systemd(<code>cronusfarm-sqlite-bridge</code>)로 NR과 동기.</li>\n<li><strong>InfluxDB 2.x</strong>: tele 등 시계열 적재, NR 플로우의 Influx write 노드·환경변수 참고.</li>\n<li><strong>Grafana</strong>: <code>grafana/dashboards/*.json</code> 자산, Pi 배포 시 대시 복사·reload 스크립트 경로 있음.</li>\n</ul></div></details>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; 명령(merge · Pi 배포)</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li><code>python scripts/merge_nodered_deploy.py --use-split</code></li>\n<li><code>.\\scripts\\deploy-cronusfarm-pi.ps1 -PiHostLan 192.168.1.22 -ApplyNodeRed -SkipArduino</code></li>\n<li>Pi: <code>sudo systemctl restart nodered.service</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"note\"><b>upcode (Windows)</b><pre>cd D:\\WorkSpace\\Study\\MyCode\\Cursor\\CronusFarm\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\upcode.ps1</pre><b style=\"display:block;margin-top:10px\">Pi 빌드(R4)</b><pre>export FQBN=arduino:renesas_uno:unor4wifi\n~/CronusFarm/scripts/pi-arduino-build.sh ~/CronusFarm/arduino/CronusFarm</pre></div>\n</div></details>\n</div>",
