    "format": "<div class=\"cf-ent\"><style>\n.cf-ent{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto}\n.cf-ent *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cf-ent h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:800}\n.cf-ent .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.cf-ent table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.78rem}\n.cf-ent th{text-align:left;color:#ffcc80;padding:6px 8px 6px 0;width:22%;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}\n.cf-ent td{color:#cfd8dc;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);word-break:break-all;font-family:Consolas,ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:0.72rem}\n.cf-ent tr:last-child th,.cf-ent tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}\n.cf-ent code{color:#fce4ec;background:#332833;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.88em}\n.cf-ent .note{margin-top:10px;font-size:0.72rem;opacity:0.9;border-left:3px solid #5c6bc0;padding-left:10px}\n</style>\n<h4>호스트·소스·URL 정체</h4>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<table>\n<tr><th>Pi 호스트</th><td><code>ida</code> · LAN <code>192.168.0.222</code> · Tailscale <code>ida.mango-larch.ts.net</code></td></tr>\n<tr><th>Node-RED 런타임</th><td><code>/home/dooly/.node-red/flows.json</code></td></tr>\n<tr><th>플로우 반영(Admin)</th><td><code>POST http://127.0.0.1:1880/admin/flows</code> (본문: 저장소 <code>merged-deploy.json</code> 배열)</td></tr>\n<tr><th>NR 환경(systemd)</th><td><code>/etc/systemd/system/nodered.service.d/</code> (예: <code>cronusfarm-influx.conf</code>, <code>cronusfarm-kma.conf</code>)</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Grafana 대시보드(파일)</th><td><code>/var/lib/grafana/dashboards/cronusfarm_operator_ui.json</code> · 프로비저 <code>/etc/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/cronusfarm.yaml</code></td></tr>\n<tr><th>저장소(Windows)</th><td><code>CronusFarm\\nodered\\merged-deploy.json</code> · <code>CronusFarm\\grafana\\dashboards\\cronusfarm_operator_ui.json</code></td></tr>\n<tr><th>백필 스크립트(Pi)</th><td><code>/home/dooly/CronusFarm/scripts/kma_backfill_influx.py</code></td></tr>\n<tr><th>URL 예</th><td>Grafana: <code>http://ida.mango-larch.ts.net:3000/d/cronusfarm-operator-ui/...</code> · CCTV: <code>http://192.168.0.222:1880/cctv/cam01/latest.jpg</code></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p class=\"note\">정본은 PC 저장소 JSON이고, Pi에서는 위 경로가 런타임·프로비저닝 대상이다. <code>merged-deploy.json</code>을 고친 뒤 Admin POST로 <code>flows.json</code>을 맞춘다.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
